<project xml:id="cool-unAlgoritmoUOtraEstrategia-1" xmlns:xi="http://www.w3.org/2001/XInclude"> 

<title>¿Un algoritmo u otra estrategia?</title>

<statement>
  <p>Para encontrar el valor de <m>299+179</m>, ¿usarías un algoritmo o usarías otra estrategia?</p>
  <p>Explica tu razonamiento.</p>
</statement>

<solution>
    <p>[+++++++++++++++]</p>
    <p>Answers vary. Sample response: Instead of using an algorithm, I would take 1 away from 179 and add it to the 299. Then I can find <m>300 + 178</m>, which is 478.</p>
  </solution>


